---
description: Ask the observer or expert only for safe evidence that distinguishes current interpretation candidates.
args: { collection: CurationCollection; interpretation: CandidateSet; request: CurationRequest }
returns: QuestionSet
---
For each decisive unknown, identify the candidate interpretations it separates and the already supplied evidence that leaves them ambiguous. Address the observer only for details available from the original observation or stored media. Do not request a return visit, specimen collection, contact with wildlife, or an unsafe action. Route specialist identification to the named expert role in collection policy. If no safe discriminating question exists, keep the candidates unresolved.
